  "requiredActualRequests": "All served source files except source/source-bundle.json, plus every shared inputs/generation file except inputs/index.json. Both exceptions are passed through the controller execution call.",
  "crossFileInvariants": [
    "All source files including all source JSON files, config/runtime and outputs/milestone-31-source/sim.cjs must belong to the frozen manifest; seven immutable numerical/helper source SHA256 pins must match.",
    "Generation and candidate supervisor sourceReceiptSha256 must equal the actual publication receipt; stage inventories must reconcile byte totals and prescribed complete file membership; every listed byte/hash is rechecked.",
    "Candidate RSS is separately <=512MiB controller and <=2GiB owned Chrome tree; no1.5GiB constraint on their aggregate. Reviewer and generation aggregate RSS <=1.5GiB.",
    "Three different private profile hashes, identical sanitized launch args and actual Chrome/V8 version, one launch per slot; supervisor observes positive browser process/sample counts and >=2 consecutive empty browser samples before each closed slot.",
    "executionConfigJSON exact UTF8 SHA256 agrees with host and browser; parsed fields equal complete frozen config plus bound actual runtimeEvidence and verified source bundle. Input index hash is independently compact-serialized using integer-only JSON numbers.",
    "Source bundle has complete exact unchanged module byte slices in fixed order; sourceReceipt proves same-process hashes and 56 named adapter checks precede the fixed scientific factory execution order.",
    "Each index generationPin equals generation summary pin and actual metadata; every frame is byte-equal to concatenated poses; initial/final poses match complete17-component state rows; shared saved input equals generated final bytes.",
    "Generator newGenerationBytesBeforeEvidence includes inputs, generation files and consumed generation-child-invocation.lock; exclude only generation-evidence.json itself from its pre-evidence total.",
    "176 unique flat page artifacts; evidence transport counts exclude itself, completion counts include itself; every chunk count independently derived from3MiB payloads; byte totals agree with actual files and closure.",
    "Completion accounting is monotone; final save adds exactly one evidence hash. Exactly45 event-loop turns, all6symbol tensors contribute408000000 raw gzip input bytes. Inclusive counters overlap and are not summed.",
    "Every process independently checks48fixed controls,6ownership builds,6qualification builds/solves and42fixed scheduled calls using immutable independent reference; full symbols exact, numerical tolerances inherited unchanged.",
    "Cross p0/p1 and p0/p2: full recursive control/ownership values; all qualified offsets/source/K/a bytes; every gzip-decoded symbol byte; all solutions and scientific metadata; qualification nonclock values; all42timing nonclock records; full source/adapter receipts.",
    "Exclude only time measurements/persistence costs, raw timing hashes, and compressed gzip encoding from cross-process equality. Full uncompressed values remain mandatory.",
    "All six N5000 case-by-process cells require median of six paired F/L ratios <=0.90 and >=5strict wins. N1000 is descriptive. No pooling or cross-cell rescue."
  ],
